# Testing Standards

- Use pytest; mirror `src/` under `tests/`
- Unit-test metrics (Recall@K, Precision@K, NDCG@K, RMSE) with known inputs
- Temporal split tests: train timestamps < test timestamps
- Synthetic fixtures only; no full MovieLens in repo
- Mock external APIs (TMDB)
- PRs adding `src/` must add tests; CI runs `pytest` + `ruff`

See `.cursor/rules/testing-rules.md`.
